Package: LFPM
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive L-Statistic Tests for Linear Factor Pricing Models
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Chenxi Zhao
Maintainer: Chenxi Zhao <chxzhao@mail.nankai.edu.cn>
Description: Implements ordered-sum and adaptive tests of intercepts in
    high-dimensional linear factor pricing models. Provides reproducible
    simulation workflows and an optional Python backend for the empirical
    workflows accompanying the September 29, 2026 integrated manuscript.
    Simulation and empirical calibration conventions are exposed separately.
    Market data must be obtained independently and are not distributed.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, grDevices, parallel
SystemRequirements: Python 3 with NumPy, pandas, SciPy, statsmodels,
    threadpoolctl and matplotlib for optional empirical reproduction;
    a C++ compiler and BLAS/LAPACK for the optional empirical QUIC solver
NeedsCompilation: no
